-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-31T12:58:07Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T16:51:30Z","closed_at":"2025-08-01T16:50:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: `4.4.1-stable`, `4.5-beta3`\n\n### System information\n\nAndroid 14\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn [Sentry GDExtension](https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-godot), we use an Android Godot plugin to facilitate communications with a library on the Android side. One of the exported methods, marked with `@UsedByGodot`, accepts a Dictionary parameter. When this method is called from a thread, Godot Engine crashes, failing to call the constructor for `org.godotengine.godot.Dictionary` on the Android side.\n\nCrash line: \nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2a9ff392645f1e1e073d937f1f6fb8feac896b2f/platform/android/jni_utils.cpp#L163\n\nStack trace:\n\n<img width=\"1767\" height=\"3060\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/615acaae-da43-49fd-9e75-4951ab944d4e\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Export a method with `@UsedByGodot` accepting `org.godotengine.godot.Dictionary` parameter.\n2. Call it from GDScript normally to verify that it works.\n3. Then spawn a Thread and call that same method on the thread.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP based on the [template project](https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-Template). I've updated the template project to Godot 4.4.1.\n\nUsage:\n1. Run `./gradle assemble` in the root of the MRP.\n2. Open `plugin/demo` in the Godot editor, and install Android Build Template.\n3. Export project to an Android device (`Use Gradle Build` should be enabled).\n\n[mrp-android-dictionary-crash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21530829/mrp-android-dictionary-crash.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109160/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109160/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}